prayer-times-android  (Apache-2.0)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  https://github.com/metinkale38/prayer-times-android
  Read at commit 0b2a8e70

Mu'mins DAY is a new application, not a copy of prayer-times-android. It
was written with that project as a reference. Taken from it so far:

  - the way the calctimes engine is called for a calculated timetable;
  - the coordinates used for the Kaaba (21.42247 N, 39.826198 E).

Anything ported from it later is added to this list.

